      "height": 369.6,
      "seed": 2124845072,
      "groupIds": [
        "4KLT3gSPigcCMvgXbFz5H"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790266990348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- and what we previously learned is that \n  when it comes to application deployments, \n  what do we want to do is make \n  the applications dynamic, \n- we want ti make it responsive changes\n  in the environment and some of the things\n  that allows for that includes :\n    ° configmaps, \n    ° secrets, \n  and \n    ° persistent volume claim",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- and what we previously learned is that \n  when it comes to application deployments, \n  what do we want to do is make \n  the applications dynamic, \n- we want ti make it responsive changes\n  in the environment and some of the things\n  that allows for that includes :\n    ° configmaps, \n    ° secrets, \n  and \n    ° persistent volume claim",
