      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- and what's going to happen is that :\n    ° OpenShift will use a ReplicaSet to do the\n      Version Control for your Deployment\n\n - so what's going to happen right now is \n   that it's going to roll out pod(s) :\n    ° A, \n    ° B \n   and \n    ° C \n\n- and these Pods are going to be behind the service ",
