      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "==> we have different strategies when it comes \n    to rolling out new versions of the Application\n    - the default is :\n        ° rolling update\n        ° the rolling update works is that :\n            1) we're firstly going to instantiate \n               a new version of the application\n            2) then add the new Pod to the Service\n            3) terminate the old one",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
