      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- So for a moment in time, what's going to happen \n  is that : \n    ° the deployment gets scaled down to 0 pod, \n    ==> in which case there are NO Endpoints\n        for the Service\n\n    ° and if any traffic goes to the Service \n      from either :\n        - the route \n      or \n        - from another application, \n      \n      what's going to happen is that:\n        ==> there's nothing to send the traffic to",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- So for a moment in time, what's going to happen \n  is that : \n    ° the deployment gets scaled down to 0 pod, \n    ==> in which case there are NO Endpoints\n        for the Service\n\n    ° and if any traffic goes to the Service \n      from either :\n        - the route \n      or \n        - from another application, \n      \n      what's going to happen is that:\n        ==> there's nothing to send the traffic to",
